        },
        "quote": "It shall be the responsibility of Grantee to take adequate measures to protect and defend its Facilities in the PROW from harm or damage. If Grantee fails to accurately or timely locate Facilities when requested, in accordance with the Kansas Underground Utility Damage Prevention Act, K.S.A. 66-1801 et seq., Grantee shall have no claim for costs or damages against the City and its authorized contractors unless such parties are responsible for the harm or damage caused by their gross negligence or intentional conduct. The City and its authorized contractors shall be responsible to take reasonable precautionary measures including observing marker posts when working near Grantee’s Facilities.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xxx-8:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
