          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-xxx-8:block:1",
          "start": 699
        },
        "quote": "Grantee shall indemnify, defend, and hold harmless the City, its officers, employees, agents, and contractors, from and against liability, claims, demands, losses, damages, fines, charges, penalties, administrative and judicial proceedings and orders, judgments, and the costs and expenses incurred in connection therewith, including reasonable attorneys’ fees and costs of defense to the extent resulting from activities undertaken by Grantee pursuant to this Agreement, except to the extent arising from or caused by the negligence or willful misconduct of the City, its officers, employees, agents, or contractors. The City shall promptly notify Grantee of any claim, action or proceeding. (Ord. 20044 § 8, 12-20-16.)",
